## 17. PPA Objective

The project is not only intended to demonstrate functional CPU design.

The primary research objective is to study the trade-off between:

```text
Power
Performance
Area
```

The initial CPU implementation will be used as the baseline.

Subsequent optimization experiments may modify:

* RTL datapath structure;
* decoder/control logic;
* mux structure;
* resource sharing;
* timing constraints;
* core utilization;
* placement parameters;
* clock-tree parameters;
* routing-related parameters.

Each experiment will be recorded and compared against the baseline.

---

