## 19. Verification Strategy

The CPU will be verified using self-checking simulation.

The initial testbench will support:

```text
instruction memory model
data memory model
clock generation
reset generation
program loading
result checking
```

The verification suite will cover:

```text
Arithmetic instructions
Logical instructions
Shift instructions
Comparison instructions
Immediate instructions
Loads
Stores
Branches
Jumps
Memory ordering within the supported model
Register x0 behavior
Reset behavior
```

Example programs will include:

```text
Arithmetic test
Memory test
Branch test
Jump test
Loop test
Fibonacci
Array operations
```

A CPU version will not be considered ready for physical implementation until the functional regression passes.

