## 21. Architecture Freeze

The following decisions are considered frozen at the end of Day 1:

```text
ISA              = RV32I
Datapath         = 32-bit
Microarchitecture= Single-cycle
Memory           = Harvard-style
Instruction bus  = 32-bit
Data bus         = 32-bit
Address          = 32-bit byte address
Endianness       = Little-endian
Registers        = 32 × 32-bit
x0               = Hardwired to zero
Alignment        = Naturally aligned accesses
Caches           = None
MMU/TLB          = None
Target technology= Sky130
RTL              = SystemVerilog
```

Any later architectural modification must be documented as a project change rather than silently changing the baseline.

